ay will discuss...\u201d or \u201cIn my opinion...\u201d\n\u2022 Avoid using \u201ca lot\u201d. If you do use it, take care not to repeat it often.\n\u2022 Avoid redundancy and repetition.\n\u2022 Be specific. Do not be vague. Do not use words such as \u201cthings\u201d or \u201cmany examples\u201d.\n\u2022 Always follow MLA format\n\u2022 Font Style: Use size 12 pt font, Times New Roman, and standard 1\u201d margins\n\u2022 EDIT, EDIT, EDIT!\n\u2022 Save your rough work.\n\u2022 When writing about literature, always write in the present tense.\n\u2022 I.e. \u201cThe Hamlet is a novel of Shakespeare\u201d not \u201cThe Hamlet was a novel of Shakespeare\u201d.\n\u2022 Essays should be submitted with one staple in the top left hand corner. Do not put them in folders."]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction"}, {"original_width": 854, "original_height": 480, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 5.874647719604652, "y": 12.146892655367232, "width": 65.7325447544953, "height": 79.66101694915255, "rotation": 0}, "id": "ZoPJkTAv2X", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 854, "original_height": 480, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 5.874647719604652, "y": 12.146892655367232, "width": 65.7325447544953, "height": 79.66101694915255, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["other"]}, "id": "ZoPJkTAv2X", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}], "created_username": "06. Doshisha nlp_annot_06@naist.ac.jp, 12", "created_ago": "0\u00a0minutes", "completed_by": {"id": 12, "first_name": "06. Doshisha", "last_name": "", "email": "nlp_annot_06@naist.ac.jp"}, "task": {"id": 136008, "data": {"ocr": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/large/datas/frederikus-h/lectrans-testset/25.10.annot_tools/label-studio/ocr_check_storage_source/lec_slides/speaking/KL_I9eE2aGk/KL_I9eE2aGk-Scene-125-03.jpg", "text": "/lectrans/data/local-files/?d=/lar